const hybrid={name:'HYBRIDGENE',sub:'CO-ARTIST / 不完美大人·出逃计划',bio:'HYBRIDGENE is credited alongside Duan Yixuan across the 2025 release 不完美大人·出逃计划. The project opens with “不完美大人” and includes “火花”, “最后的独角兽”, “未命名关系”, “住在海边的猫” and “逃出宇宙的尽头”, followed by their instrumental versions.',facts:[['SHARED RELEASE','段艺璇 × HYBRIDGENE'],['CATALOGUE','6 songs + 6 instrumental versions'],['RELEASE','19 August 2025 / 飓风源']],sources:[['RELEASE & ARTIST CREDITS · SPOTIFY','https://open.spotify.com/album/3SdKsD6BKfGhK0cx1ueOgn']]};
